cff-version: 1.2.0
title: mascot-forge
message: >-
  If you use mascot-forge in your work, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Andrew
    family-names: Lawson
    email: andrew@dataweb.co.za
repository-code: "https://github.com/rockhoppa123/mascot-forge"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, dependency-free pipeline that turns flat art into a data-reactive web component you
  own: rigged in the browser, with a state machine binding animation states to live application data,
  emitted as editable SVG/CSS or React+GSAP code.
keywords:
  - svg-animation
  - gsap
  - state-machine
  - data-visualization
  - code-generation
  - mascot
license: MIT
